## 9. Quality gates before "ready to ship"

Each one of these has to be a "yes" or shipping is premature.

- [ ] All Phase 1–9 acceptance criteria pass
- [ ] `expo-doctor` returns clean
- [ ] App is < 30 MB download size on both platforms (Skia adds ~6 MB; budget the rest)
- [ ] Tested on a real low-end Android device (the spring physics on a $150 phone is the real test)
- [ ] Tested on the oldest iOS device the SDK still supports (iPhone XS as of SDK 55)
- [ ] Web build works in Safari (CanvasKit has historically been a sore spot here — verify)
- [ ] Memory usage stable over 30 minutes of continuous use (no leaks from animation frames)
- [ ] Battery impact < 5%/hour during active use (GPU rendering should be efficient, but verify)

